# Build conventions

- All versions live in `gradle/libs.versions.toml`. Reference them as
  `libs.<alias>`; never hard-code a version in a module build script.
- JVM toolchain is JDK 25 (ADR-0011). Do not lower it for a single module.
- `tassel-core` targets: `jvm`, `wasmJs { browser(); nodejs() }`, `macosArm64`,
  `linuxX64`. Adding or dropping a target needs an ADR.
- Keep the configuration cache working. No `project.` access at execution
  time, no eager task creation (`tasks.register`, not `tasks.create`).
- New dependencies must be declared in the PR description. Dependencies in
  `commonMain` must publish all four core targets.

```kotlin
// BAD
implementation("com.github.ajalt.clikt:clikt:5.0.3")

// GOOD
implementation(libs.clikt)
```
